  "2026-10-23T23:41:18.091Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: exact all-state ext-apps bundled Zod search returned0 after the complete strict corpus read; current open/in_progress lists were refreshed. Independent security review and a bounded direct probe found the unused vendor copy; current latest registry package remains2.0.3. This is a forward adoption constraint with no demonstrated public CLI exploit path. Left open and unclaimed because this PR does not rewrite upstream bundles."
